ore AVDD leaves regulation." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 136.896 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "65d4e24b-c315-4142-87f0-82f978908c32")) (rectangle (start 203.2 130.81) (end 403.835 196.855) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "b329e8fb-468b-4f6b-9f6b-53525ac4ad62")) (text "Battery side and ship FET" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 207.01 133.096 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "02447ce5-04cf-40fa-96ef-2304790eb973")) (text "Q400 between pack and BAT, source on the charger side: its body diode blocks pack discharge in ship mode. BATP senses the pack side through 100R." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 207.01 136.896 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "57fa5cfe-3ab3-45e5-b634-766104174fe4")) (rectangle (start 15.24 204.47) (end 193.05 239.162) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "fa6b3487-8a1b-451a-bcdd-aeb14028ea37")) (text "Configuration straps" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 206.756 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "732b73e4-609f-4c72-a567-9ceb7597d4d5")) (text "PROG 6.04k: 2S, 1.5 MHz. ILIM_HIZ = REGN x 10/37: hardware input ceiling about 0.37 A (max 0.44 A), below the 500 mA USB default. TS: 5.23k/30.1k window for a 103AT NTC" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 210.556 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5695f8bf-f0da-4ecf-a327-11f73dca4f02")) (text "(charge 0-60 C, JEITA)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 212.741 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "23e954de-c06f-4d8b-9263-f4e699f937f5")) (rectangle (start 200.66 204.47) (end 333.186 236.43) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "603693a0-61a8-4310-9283-32e34594e604")) (text "Charge enable" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 204.47 206.756 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f58c8c6a-4628-4af2-aff0-cd3479ed246c")) (text "CE low enables charging. R406 holds CE high from REGN; Q401 pulls it low only while CHARGE_REQUEST is high, so charging stays" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 204.47 210.556 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9912f5a9-ef0d-4cd1-9357-7d0b6997e771")) (text "off whenever the MCU is not running." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 204.47 212.741 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "66075436-1d63-4b6f-a3b5-7be56f957f10")) (rectangle (start 340.36 204.47) (end 482.529 247.925) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "b7ff535c-1045-47c6-8036-adc7b4590170")) (text "Charge LED, power button" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 344.17 206.756 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2b6f3483-62c7-4ac9-8532-5a7dfdf19784")) (text "STAT LED lit from REGN (USB present): on while charging, 1 Hz blink on fault. POWER drives QON; BAT54 gives the MCU a 3.3 V-safe copy" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 344.17 210.556 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "de434bac-c207-4144-965e-935dfe99aeb7")) (text "(QON idles near 3.2 V)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 344.17 212.741 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "098a7a74-d4d8-464d-8ca3-06ac3289fc9e")) (rectangle (start 15.24 255.27) (end 220.66 283.485) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "698f36aa-4d03-478f-aa32-15ae3b3cecf9")) (text "Sheet notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 257.556 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eabcdb02-feac-4a05-ac97-64c4b1e05558")) (text "On battery the BQ25798 does not switch: its battery FET connects the pack to SYS. With USB present it powers SYS and charges the pack; SERVICE_OK keeps the ADC off." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 261.356 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9be40bd6-cb5e-4523-822f-344234bef789")) (text "Firmware: read TUSB320 advertised current, then set EN_EXTILIM = 0 and IINDPM to the allowed budget; disable AUTO_INDET_EN (D+/D- not connected); set ICHG 0.5 A, VREG 8.4 V, JEITA limits from the pack" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 263.541 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d481b64d-90fc-4886-bf26-e98d4321e55b")) (text "data sheet; service or disable the 40 s watchdog (on expiry the hardware ceiling returns)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 265.726 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "98803aed-88b1-4836-a8bd-e248d3b77b24")) (text "Soft-off: firmware writes SDRV_CTRL = 10 (ship mode); Q400 opens and the whole board, supervisor dividers included, loses power. Hold POWER 1 s or plug USB to wake. Holding POWER 10 s forces a system" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 267.911 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3f4ee9a1-0a17-4c38-8cf0-f08f903bb186")) (text "power reset." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 270.096 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5653b3c4-5e3d-4cc1-8473-2e7cd52936fb")) (text "Layout: follow the TI layout guide - VBUS/PMID/SYS/BAT capacitors and the 100 nF parts at the pins, short SW1/SW2 loop, BATP Kelvin to the pack side of Q400. Keep the converter away from the electrode" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 272.281 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "360cc779-3b4e-4e3d-94fa-7610b7a52ecc")) (text "inputs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 274.466 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e201a0c9-2f34-466e-a4f3-fccce116c4cd")))